71-25/39001683_703850503307522_9041964880403365888_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Ue-xPN_QgxMQ7kNvwEoZw4n&_nc_oc=AdqvjRP0ZdSiR7yS_eOBP72bpWA_caZIZ19fSDg-QCBcVFg_DjkzCHj5Xinvdxr4xDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSV5ydSnP-D1ziImoqzon1FXxA828ndCu8s9oRYj1zIVA&oe=6AFC7742"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Space Shooter", "keywords": ["Space", "Shooter"], "long_description": "VR Space Shooter is a Space Adventure game in VR where you have to shoot down the enemy space ships and the Asteroids that approach you.\n\nSpace Shooter is one of the most loved genre of games, everyone has fascination about space. \nVR Space Shooter helps you experience exactly that. \n\nThis game is designed and tested in Oculus Go headset.\n\nThe game is simple. You are in charge of a space ship. You are wandering in space. There are enemy ships trying to kill you. Before they hit you with their missiles, you have to kill them all. All you have to do is STEER your ship by looking around. Guide your ship through the gates to get scores and Shoot down enemy spaceship and asteroids.\n\nFeatures\n- Realistic environment\n- Explosion animation\n- Sound effects\n\nSo what are you waiting for, download VR Space Shooter today & get ready for a cosmic shooting adventure!", "short_description": "VR Space Shooter is a Space Adventure game in VR where you have to shoot down the enemy space ships and the Asteroids that approach you."}]}, "developer_name": "Chipsy Informtation Technology Services", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.chipsyservices.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.chipsyservices.com/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "Chipsy Informtation Technology Services", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.chipsyservices.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "con